  "Run remaining stages": "",
  "Run the embedding-assisted duplicate review twice before showing proposals. Each run uses the cached concept Embedings to generate a small set of semantically close deletion candidates, then sends only those candidates to the selected AI model for confirmation. The two result sets are combined before review. Nothing is deleted until you review the confirmed duplicate groups. For every confirmed duplicate group, the concept with the lowest chapter id is kept; ties inside the same chapter are broken by the lowest concept id, and every other concept in the group is proposed for deletion.": "",
